API.md W10, W5: over examples/features/edits with the staging layer active and no edit layer,
Set of server.retries, which the layer amends, is ErrNotEditable with reason layered.
-- options --
example: features/edits
pkgs: features.edits
layers: staging
-- edit.json --
{"ops": [
  {"op": "set", "path": "server.retries", "value": 4}
]}
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
}
-- result.json --
{
  "error": "op 0: value not editable: reason layered"
}
